hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19210","Yazid ibn Harun narrated to us, Yahya meaning Ibn Said informed us that Abbad ibn Tamim informed him from Uwaymir ibn Ashqar that he slaughtered before the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) went out, and that he mentioned that to the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) after he finished, so the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) ordered him to repeat his sacrifice."
